cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Aerospace Kinetic Regeneration Suite: Transient Kinetic Energy Recovery and Thermal Mitigation in Aerospace MGUs"
message: "If you use this multi-physics simulation suite or architectural model in your research or project, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Singh"
    given-names: "Abhishek"
    role: "Lead Author / Sole Inventor"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Abhishek1033ubuntu/aerospace-kinetic-regeneration-suite"
abstract: "A multi-physics control logic, material formulation, and differential numerical validation suite for an Ultra-Fast Capacitive-Pulsed MGU Architecture. Integrates Silver-Plated Cu-Gr Litz wire, an ultracapacitor DC-link buffer, active SiC back-EMF ABS-analogy pulsing, and dynamic ram-air Cu-Diamond MMC heat sinks to achieve 92.1%–94.5% kinetic energy recovery efficiency under severe 1.2G deceleration transients."
keywords:
  - Aerospace Engineering
  - Motor-Generator Unit (MGU)
  - Regenerative Braking
  - Hybrid Energy Storage
  - Thermal Mitigation
  - Silicon Carbide
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-10"
